# Git-only ignore for agents/.agents/skills/, which mixes tracked bundled skill
# directories with runtime vendor symlinks. Git can't ignore only symlinks, so we
# allowlist: ignore skills/*, then un-ignore each bundled skill by name.
#
# Must stay outside skills/: skill discovery reads ignore files inside its scan
# root, where this whitelist would hide every bundled skill. Add new skills below.
skills/*
!skills/commit-summarizer/
!skills/pdf2md-polish/
!skills/script-analyzer/
